# Runtime state (regenerable): benchmark runs, trajectories, the model response cache
runs/
state/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.jsonl.log

# Committed on purpose: docs/experiments/ holds the grades, aggregates and reports the
# README cites -- 134 KB in total. The full per-step trajectory dumps are not committed:
# they are 4.1 MB for one scripted pair of runs and grow with every real-model run, and
# `bash scripts/run_experiments.sh` regenerates them byte for byte from the seed. The
# aggregates and grades derived from them are committed, so every number in RESULTS.md is
# still checkable without them.
docs/experiments/*/trajectories.jsonl

# Local logs and IDE files
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
